{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBHbXQ41ySVmXC8efir8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six acceptance criteria pass. The changes are uncommitted in the worktree.\n\n**What changed**\n- **`cmd/shortlink/main.go`**: added a `serve` subcommand using the `flag` package. `--addr` defaults to `127.0.0.1:8787` and `--data` to `links.json`. It calls `server.New(data)`; on error it prints `shortlink serve: <err>` to stderr and exits 1. Otherwise it runs `http.ListenAndServe`. The `version` and `help` output is unchanged, and the usage text lists `serve`.\n- **`cmd/shortlink/main_test.go`**: added a table-driven test for `serve` with a directory and an unparseable file as the data path. It checks exit 1 and that stderr names the path.\n- **`testdata/seed.json`**: new file with the `zurdo` and `carol` links from req-seed.\n\n**Verification**\n- Unreadable data path: `serve --data testdata` exits 1 and prints `shortlink serve: read testdata: read testdata: is a directory`. The doubled `read testdata:` comes from the store's existing error wrapping; I left it alone.\n- Live server on 127.0.0.1:8787 (served by `scripts/devserver.sh`, which I did not touch or restart): `/healthz` returns 200 `ok`; `/api/links` lists both seed links; `/api/links/carol` returns the carol URL; `/api/links/nope` returns 404; `/zurdo` returns `302 https://github.com/ElOrlis/zurdo`.\n- The gofmt, vet (with and without `-tags=preauthored`) and full test run all exit 0.\n\nI didn't independently confirm that the server on 8787 was built from this worktree. Its responses match the new seed data, and this worktree has the most recent `.go` changes, so the devserver should have picked it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1092,"cache_read_input_tokens":39308,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1092},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61af20a2-088b-4744-bc48-6ec774f6c578","uuid":"80529c4f-f69f-4033-8b4b-d8babf6fff20","timestamp":"2026-10-19T08:33:29.950Z","request_id":"req_011CgBHbX8vcrVaT2PVHJsp9"}
